#### CREATE TRIP
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Content-Type: application/json  
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Japan to Paris",
  "startDate": "2024-07-01",
  "endDate": "2024-07-10",
  "budget": {
    "total": 2000
  },
